WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.113 --> 00:00:19.427
- [Evan] A subscriber,
Jay, wrote to me to tell me

00:00:19.427 --> 00:00:21.291
that he wants to start a flower shop

00:00:21.291 --> 00:00:23.628
and asked me how he could stand out.

00:00:23.628 --> 00:00:27.703
Now, the flower industry is
brutal, ridiculously brutal.

00:00:27.703 --> 00:00:29.625
Margins are being squeezed by supermarkets

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:31.035
and online stores.

00:00:31.035 --> 00:00:32.492
There are fewer flower growers,

00:00:32.492 --> 00:00:35.226
making it harder to find
locally grown products.

00:00:35.226 --> 00:00:38.487
It's one of the most
competitive online businesses,

00:00:38.487 --> 00:00:40.040
so good luck with getting people to search

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.879
and find your website.

00:00:41.879 --> 00:00:44.717
When the economy is down,
luxury items like flowers

00:00:44.717 --> 00:00:47.600
are the first thing people
stop spending money on.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.535
The big refill partners
like funeral parlors

00:00:49.535 --> 00:00:51.273
and banquet halls already have

00:00:51.273 --> 00:00:53.451
long standing relationships with florists.

00:00:53.451 --> 00:00:56.983
Man, who wants to be
in the flower business?

00:00:56.983 --> 00:01:00.624
Jay did, so I was going to help him.

00:01:00.624 --> 00:01:02.101
The secret was for Jay to realize

00:01:02.101 --> 00:01:04.670
that he wasn't selling flowers.

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:07.607
He was selling something
much more powerful.

00:01:07.607 --> 00:01:10.461
Jay was really selling calm.

00:01:10.461 --> 00:01:12.475
What I learned from Jay
was that he loves flowers

00:01:12.475 --> 00:01:14.625
because they make you feel calm.

00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:17.052
If he's stressed or worried,
he looks at the flowers

00:01:17.052 --> 00:01:18.827
and becomes calm.

00:01:18.827 --> 00:01:20.442
That's his core.

00:01:20.442 --> 00:01:23.462
For Jay to avoid massive
failure and beat the odds,

00:01:23.462 --> 00:01:25.545
he needs to embrace calm.

00:01:27.096 --> 00:01:30.485
And it's so much more than
just having great flowers.

00:01:30.485 --> 00:01:31.738
His store should be a haven

00:01:31.738 --> 00:01:34.104
for people who want to feel calm.

00:01:34.104 --> 00:01:36.446
He should sell flowers
that make people calm.

00:01:36.446 --> 00:01:39.481
He should have signage outside
that make people feel calm.

00:01:39.481 --> 00:01:42.152
He should play music,
hire staff, greet people,

00:01:42.152 --> 00:01:44.600
fill the air with scent,
and have a store layout

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:46.930
that makes people calm.

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:48.185
He should get involved with charities

00:01:48.185 --> 00:01:51.358
that help people deal with
stress and overcoming trauma.

00:01:51.358 --> 00:01:53.238
Talking with Jay or anyone on his team

00:01:53.238 --> 00:01:56.007
should make you feel calm.

00:01:56.007 --> 00:01:59.186
For him to be successful, he
needs others to experience

00:01:59.186 --> 00:02:03.182
the calm feeling that he loves
getting from his flowers.

00:02:03.182 --> 00:02:04.817
And it's easy to do.

00:02:04.817 --> 00:02:06.559
It doesn't have to be fake.

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:09.276
It's not just a marketing strategy

00:02:09.276 --> 00:02:12.238
because that's who Jay is.

00:02:12.238 --> 00:02:15.512
He just needs to embrace it and share it.

00:02:15.512 --> 00:02:17.881
Then, his flower shop
will become a destination

00:02:17.881 --> 00:02:20.387
for people who want to be calm.

00:02:20.387 --> 00:02:22.912
He'll attract people he'll
naturally get along with,

00:02:22.912 --> 00:02:25.009
who will buy more
flowers, spend more money,

00:02:25.009 --> 00:02:27.459
refer more customers,
and won't compare him

00:02:27.459 --> 00:02:32.231
to the dozen roses you
can buy online for $19.99.

00:02:32.231 --> 00:02:35.058
That's core selling, and
it applies to much more

00:02:35.058 --> 00:02:36.268
than just selling.

00:02:36.268 --> 00:02:39.083
It's a philosophy for how
you run your entire business

00:02:39.083 --> 00:02:40.642
and your life.

00:02:40.642 --> 00:02:42.965
Almost nobody does it,
and it's your chance

00:02:42.965 --> 00:02:45.132
to dominate your industry.

